; Gezira renders KSWorld documents in an SDL3 window, with the mouse: what's being built, what each piece builds on, and what
; would show it works.  MARU_PLAN=render notes/plan/record asks the checks; MARU_PLAN=render ./eval notes/plan/next.l says
; what's next.  The Nile runtime's pieces follow docs/plans/2026-10-15-nile-runtime-in-maru.md (RFC
; docs/rfc/draft-ndn-nile-runtime-in-maru-02.md); the document's side builds on notes/plan/ksworld.john.

start-world plan.
load "notes/plan/probes.l".

set Evidence = untested | passed(tree) | failed(tree)
  | tested(tree, trials) | proved(tree, cases) | refuted(tree, counterexample) | starved(tree, met, drawn)
  | vacuous(tree) | inconclusive(tree, input).
group Good passed tested proved.

group Check Case Measure Grammar Law.
create Case evidence.
create Measure evidence command cadence.
create Grammar evidence file class rule host inherits samples.
create Law evidence file support.
qualify Case observe is it case-passes.
qualify Measure observe is it command-succeeds.
qualify Grammar observe is it compiles-and-reads.
qualify Law observe is it law-verdict.
qualify Check routine if 1 = 1.
qualify Measure routine if its cadence = "routine".

make Measure WholeSuite untested "nice make check" "full".

; the Nile runtime in typed Maru, task by task
make Case nile_interface untested.
make Case nile_osdefs untested.
make Case nile_startup untested.
make Case nile_recip untested.
make Case nile_limits untested.
make Case nile_oom untested.
make Case nile_prefix untested.
make Case nile_reroute untested.
make Case nile_reverse untested.
make Case nile_sort untested.
make Case nile_dupcat untested.
make Case nile_threads untested.
make Case nile_tsan untested.
make Case nile_text_layout untested.
; what draws, and where
make Case gezira_image untested.			; a Gezira scene rendered to pixels, as the C runtime renders it
make Case sdl3_window untested.			; a window shows a pixel buffer, and mouse events come back
make Case ksworld_headless untested.		; a document's streams run, and its boxes' paths are fed to Gezira pipelines
make Case ksworld_text untested.		; a document's spans laid out as TrueType glyph paths
make Case ksworld_render untested.		; a document rendered through Gezira to pixels, against its bundle's preview
make Case ksworld_mouse untested.		; a click lands on the box under it, fires its streams, and the redraw shows it

create Code tree.
action Check observed Answer consequence its evidence = Answer.
qualify Check holds if its evidence is Good and its evidence tree = Now tree.
qualify Check stale if its evidence is Good and not its evidence tree = Now tree.

create Capability what where shown-by builds-on planned.
make Capability NileInterface "nile.k is the one interface; the Maru generator passes sizeof_vars"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile.k" [ nile_interface ] [ ] no.
make Capability NileThreads "pthread types sized from nile.osdefs; a worker pool that starts, syncs and shuts down"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-sync.k, nile-heap.k, nile-deque.k, nile-thread.k" [ nile_osdefs, nile_startup ] [ NileInterface ] no.
make Capability NileProcesses "processes and the kernel interface, with the limits and running out of memory"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-process.k, nile-kernel.k" [ nile_recip, nile_limits, nile_oom, nile_prefix, nile_reroute ] [ NileThreads ] no.
make Capability NileBuiltins "the remaining built-ins, and every thread count giving the same answer, race-free"
  "nile/runtimes/maru/nile-builtins.k" [ nile_reverse, nile_sort, nile_dupcat, nile_threads, nile_tsan ] [ NileProcesses ] no.
make Capability NileEndToEnd "text-layout.nl runs end to end through Maru, as the C runtime ran it"
  "nile/, check/check.l" [ nile_text_layout ] [ NileBuiltins ] no.
make Capability GeziraImage "Gezira's kernels, compiled through Maru, render a scene to pixels"
  "gezira/, the Nile runtime" [ gezira_image ] [ NileEndToEnd ] no.
make Capability Sdl3Window "an SDL3 window shows a pixel buffer each frame and hands back mouse and key events"
  "sdl3.osdefs, sdl3.k" [ sdl3_window ] [ ] no.
make Capability DocumentScene "a document's boxes feed their shapes' paths to libgezira pipelines, each placed by its matrix and painted in its fill"
  "ksworld-render.l" [ ksworld_headless ] [ ] no.
make Capability DocumentText "a document's text spans are laid out with TrueType glyph outlines, quadratic Béziers Gezira draws"
  "a TrueType byte grammar, ksworld-text.l" [ ksworld_text ] [ DocumentScene ] no.
make Capability DocumentRendered "a document is rendered through Gezira to pixels, and matches its bundle's preview"
  "ksworld-render.l" [ ksworld_render ] [ GeziraImage, DocumentText ] no.
make Capability MouseHandled "in an SDL3 window, a click lands on the box under it, fires its streams, and the redraw shows it"
  "ksworld-window.l" [ ksworld_mouse ] [ DocumentRendered, Sdl3Window ] no.
make Capability NothingElseBroke "every other check in the repository still passes"
  "the whole tree" [ WholeSuite ] [ MouseHandled ] no.

qualify Capability proven if its shown-by size > 0 and for every its shown-by do each holds = yes.
qualify Capability done if it proven = yes or it planned = yes.
qualify Capability ready if for every its builds-on do each done = yes.
rel-qualify Capability:A depends-on Capability:B if B in A builds-on.
rel-qualify Check:C supports Capability:K if C in K shown-by.
qualify Check regressed if not its evidence is Good and not its evidence is untested
  and for some time A up to time do (at time A its evidence is Good).

create Team.
make Team T.
action Team build Capability consequence Capability planned = yes.
rule Team build is Capability done = no.
rule Team build is Capability ready = yes.
goal Team deliver try for every all Capability do each done = yes.
goal-strategy Team deliver sat.
